    "Keep the reconstructed experiment profile separate from the production OS wrapper; do not promote any ledger item to public ABI without separate verification.",
    "Build the OS-facing DTB from the source split and run a two-kernel compatibility matrix offline and at runtime; the minimal in-place candidate 3e83798e... has completed the offline carrier check, but runtime activation remains a separate G3 step.",
    "Use the additive k270-to-candidate semantic result as the runtime matrix baseline; boot k270 and k363 separately with candidate DTB only in an approved G3 window.",
